        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Imperial USA DL-DB251, ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ADA Compliant Deadbolt features a 6-pin Schlage \"C\" keyway so you know it is both secure, and easy to have <a href=\"/pages/lock-keying\">keyed</a> to match your existing Schlage locks. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock meets ANSI grade 3 requirements. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 2\" thick with backsets of 2-3/8” or 2-3/4″. For residential and light duty commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis deadbolt also available: <a href=\"/products/ada-kwikset-keyway-deadbolt-imperial-usa-dl-db251kw-us32d\"><b>Kwikset Key Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DL-DB200 Series Handicap Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 3 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8” or 2-3/4″</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>1/4″ Heavy Gauge Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: 6 pin solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: Brushed Stainless Steel or Black</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed and reversible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "ADA Compliant Deadbolt",
                "description": "The ADA Compliant Deadbolt features a 6-pin Schlage C keyway so you know it is both secure, and easy to have keyed to match your existing Schlage locks. This ADA Compliant Handicap Door Lock meets ANSI grade 3 requirements. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "ADA Compliant Deadbolts, Imperial USA DL-DB251, Handicap Door Locks, ada deadbolts, ada compliant door hardware, ada compliant locks, DL-DB200 Series Residential Tubular Deadbolts, DL-DB200 Series Grade 3 Deadbolts, global door controls DL-DB200 deadbolts, trans atlantic deadbolts, IMP-DL-DB251-US32D deadbolt, IMP-DL-DB251-US10B deadbolt,"
